# Empty placeholder.
#
# Used as ENTERPRISE_SRC during image smoke-tests when we want to verify the
# image build flow itself without yet having the real enterprise tree on disk.
#
# To build the REAL enterprise image:
#   1. Clone github.com/odoo/enterprise into /opt/odoo-saas/enterprise on the server
#   2. docker build -f docker/enterprise/Dockerfile -t clickbuild/odoo-enterprise:19 \
#                   --build-arg ENTERPRISE_SRC=./enterprise .
